  "contracts": {
    "entry": "0x50b0f9..0x50b106 switches a nonzero display mode to trace before opening width.0x50b159 calls normal Show0x47a010 directly;this call returns without setting modal-state bit8 or entering the distinct modal loop.",
    "showDistinction": "0x47a010 calls visible/activation helpers and returns. VMT+0xfc for recovered TCustomForm,TForm,TEqvWdthCntrl,TSpClassify,TObsRsltsDlg1 resolves0x47a100,whose0x47a1ab sets state+0x358bit8 and0x47a282..0x47a2c8 runs a ModalResult loop. Full SEH cleanup and return captured through0x47a401. Method labels are recovered structural interpretations,not debug symbols or executed behavior.",
    "activeWidth": "Width FormCreate creates its result form. FormShow0x506648 sets main classification+0x571=1 and hides an old width-result form;these bodies contain no main-mode-menu disable. The width DFM is fsStayOnTop,with OnCreate/FormCreate and OnShow/FormShow. Combined menu items bind CombPhotoTrace1Click and have no resource Enabled=False.",
    "combined": "Handler0x509424 sets display mode2,clears difference,updates checked state and repaints;no width-active+0x571check. Setter0x5077d0 stores+0x494 and checks the three display menus;popup0x509624 copies checked state. This direct normal-show/event chain supports later combined selection while width active,not complete Win32 focus/reentry parity.",
    "source": "Resolver0x50670f..0x506819 uses selected pane baseline+0x503. Unknown bottom+0x517 resolves unknown+0x4bf. Upper bottom+0x50f resolves current atlas row,lower bottom+0x51f resolves next row. Combined mode painting keeps the unknown trace in the bottom pane;resolver has no combined override.",
    "nextResultsGap": "Native classification-result entry0x50b1dc..0x50b2c2 calls result preparation0x54a73c,copies original Extended fields,then calls the result form through VMT+0xfc. Its editor/field/record/interchange contract remains unrecovered for the web and is not implemented by this source-route increment."
  },
  "implemented": [
    "Existing unchecked source-from-center option now routes an admitted combined bottom center to actual lower-standard choice. Unknown polyline/identity/bytes remain unchanged and visible-source versus width-source labels are explicit.",
    "Only actual admitted lower token may be selected;missing token does not fall back to Unknown. Committed center/shoulders use actual displayed bottom frame and remain manual. Same-panel origin,held transform/context cancellation,paired-pan known-zero and immutable-review guards retained.",
    "Lower annotations remain confined to the bound bottom representation;unknown photograph never borrows them. Inspect remains actual rendered Unknown. Disabling automatic selection preserves explicit Unknown workflow.",
    "Continuous-coordinate editing,source selection at center rather than confirmation,unchecked opt-in,early availability guards,temporary reference results and browser transaction ordering are declared web adapters.",
    "No integrator,sampler,normalization,acquisition/count/seed,confirmed record,grading or persistent-format change. All1279 original manifested resource bytes/hashes retained."
  ],
